msgid "SquashFS"
msgstr "SquashFS"

msgid ""
"ReliefNT 默认内建 ``CONFIG_SQUASHFS=y``。它提供 SquashFS 4.0 的只读挂载， 支持 gzip "
"压缩块和未压缩块、普通文件、目录、稀疏文件及软硬链接， 并保留文件权限、数字属主和属组。无需载入整个解压后的镜像。"
msgstr ""
"ReliefNT enables ``CONFIG_SQUASHFS=y`` by default. It mounts SquashFS 4.0 images "
"read-only and supports gzip-compressed and uncompressed blocks, regular files, "
"directories, sparse files, symbolic links, and hard links. It preserves file "
"permissions and numeric user and group IDs. The full decompressed image does not need"
" to be loaded into memory."

msgid "制作和挂载镜像"
msgstr "Creating and mounting an image"

msgid "在宿主机生成兼容镜像（``staging`` 为要打包的目录）::"
msgstr "Create a compatible image on the host, where ``staging`` is the directory to package::"

msgid ""
"镜像必须位于支持的块设备上。引导器以 ``reliefos-installer-payload`` 为名称提供 Multiboot2 模块时，内核将其注册为只读 "
"``/dev/ram1``。从来宾挂载："
msgstr ""
"Place the image on a supported block device. If the bootloader supplies a Multiboot2 "
"module named ``reliefos-installer-payload``, the kernel registers it as the read-only"
" device ``/dev/ram1``. Mount it from the guest:"

msgid "限制"
msgstr "Limitations"

msgid ""
"不支持写入、fragment 尾块、扩展属性或 gzip 以外的压缩算法。 目录项名称仍受 ReliefNT 现有目录接口限制，最多 127 字节。 当前尚未接入 GPT"
" 分区上的 SquashFS 挂载；普通镜像文件也不能直接传给 ``mount(2)``，应通过已支持的块设备提供。"
msgstr ""
"This implementation does not support writes, fragment blocks, extended attributes, or"
" compression algorithms other than gzip. The existing ReliefNT directory interface "
"limits names to 127 bytes. SquashFS mounting on GPT partitions is not supported yet. "
"Use a supported block device because regular image files cannot be passed directly to"
" ``mount(2)``."
